            'note' => 'The Driver runs the main program and creates the SparkContext/SparkSession, converting code into a Directed Acyclic Graph (DAG) of execution stages. Cluster Manager (YARN, K8s, Standalone) allocates worker resources. Executors run on worker nodes, executing assigned tasks across CPU slots in parallel. Transformations (e.g. select, filter, groupBy) build logical plans lazily without running compute; Actions (e.g. count, collect, write) trigger DAG evaluation and compute jobs.',
